msgstr "启用 WAN 丢弃/拒绝日志"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:183
msgid "Enable WAN zone drop/reject logging (same as Network → Firewall)."
msgstr "启用 WAN 区域的丢弃/拒绝日志记录（同 网络 → 防火墙）。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:189
msgid "Enable logging"
msgstr "启用日志"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2249
msgid ""
"Enable logging turns on WAN zone drop/reject logging only (same as Network → "
"Firewall). It does not add rules or log normal LAN browsing."
msgstr ""
"启用日志仅开启 WAN 区域的丢弃/拒绝日志记录（同 网络 → 防火墙），不会添加规"
"则，也不会记录正常的 LAN 浏览。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:60
#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:189
