msgstr "改为排除"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2176
msgid "Fetch budget"
msgstr "抓取配额"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2257
msgid ""
"Fetch budget controls raw log lines per poll. Auto derives from Limit; "
"Manual selects a bounded maximum."
msgstr ""
"抓取配额控制每次轮询的原始日志行数。「自动」由行数限制推导；「手动」可选择一"
"个有上限的最大值。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/links.js:63
