msgid "The firewall did not reload; saved and live logging may differ."
msgstr "防火墙未能重新加载；已保存的日志设置与当前生效状态可能不一致。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2282
msgid ""
"The rate shown for WAN logging is the firewall zone log_limit. OpenWrt "
"defaults to 10/minute when no explicit limit is configured; fwlive does not "
"impose this cap."
msgstr ""
"WAN 日志显示的速率是防火墙区域的 log_limit。未显式配置时 OpenWrt 默认为 10 "
"条/分钟；此上限并非 fwlive 施加。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2277
msgid ""
"The router log ring may evict older events before fwlive reads them. fwlive "
"cannot recover evicted entries or change forwarding behavior."
msgstr ""
"路由器日志环形缓冲区可能在 fwlive 读取前淘汰较旧事件。fwlive 无法恢复已淘汰的"
"条目，也不会改变转发行为。"

